@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans

title Arquitectura runtime en RTX 3060 12GB

node "Host Linux" {
  node "Proceso Gradio\nPython" as APP {
    component "app.py" as APPPY
    component "Diffusers Pipeline" as DIFF
    component "Modulo Masking" as MASK
  }

  node "GPU CUDA" as GPU {
    component "UNet/atencion\nfloat16" as GUNET
    component "VAE parcial" as GVAE
  }

  node "CPU RAM" as CPU {
    component "Offload secuencial\nAccelerate" as OFFLOAD
    component "OpenPose temporal" as OPOSECPU
    component "DensePose en low-ram" as DPCPU
  }

  database "Cache HF\n~/.cache/huggingface" as CACHE
  folder "Checkpoints locales\nckpt/" as CKPTS
  folder "Logs\nlogs/latest.log" as LOGS
}

APPPY --> DIFF
APPPY --> MASK
MASK --> OPOSECPU
MASK --> DPCPU
DIFF --> GUNET
DIFF --> GVAE
DIFF <--> OFFLOAD : IDMVTON_CPU_OFFLOAD=1
DIFF --> CACHE
DIFF --> CKPTS
APPPY --> LOGS

note right of OFFLOAD
Regla operativa:
si hay offload activo, evitar
movimientos manuales pipe.to(...)
para no romper meta tensors.
end note

note bottom
Objetivo del perfil 12GB:
reducir picos de VRAM con fp16,
attention slicing, VAE slicing/tiling,
y resolucion reducida (576x768) en low-ram.
end note

@enduml